sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Recovering a timed out job
  accDescr: The worker reports a timeout. The caller retries with the same job identifier.
  participant Caller
  participant API
  participant Worker
  Caller->>API: Submit job with stable ID
  API->>Worker: Run job
  alt completes before deadline
    Worker-->>API: Result
    API-->>Caller: Succeeded
  else timeout
    Worker-->>API: Timeout
    API-->>Caller: Failed, retry available
    Caller->>API: Retry same job ID
    API->>Worker: Retry job
  end
